WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,260
Xiaoxia, Xiaoyan, you are finally back.

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:05,260
I have something big to tell you

3
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:07,260
I had so much fun chatting with your Aunt Lan

4
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,260
I decided to adopt her as my daughter

5
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:11,260
We have already registered at the household registration department.

6
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,260
Back up and discuss again later

7
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,260
You usually call me grandpa

8
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,260
You can still call me brother in private

9
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,260
A ghost in private

10
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,260
What is this?

11
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,260
Aunt Lan is so good

12
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:23,920
I’ll make delicious food for you and Baby Xia

13
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:26,920
From now on, you two will be my precious faces.

14
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:30,880
Xiaoxia will be your biological sister from now on

15
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:32,880
You have to protect her well

16
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,880
I just want to have a good granddaughter like Xiaoxia

17
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:44,850
Now I finally realize Xiaoxia you
